# Normalize to LF in the repo and in the working tree. Rust, TS and the corpus are all
# line-ending sensitive in ways that are painful to debug.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Fixtures are test data: their bytes are the point. Never touch line endings here — a fixture
# rewritten to CRLF silently changes what the corpus asserts.
tests/fixtures/** -text

*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
